            "review_title": "Review at Abracado",
            "review_text": "Stan1000000\nLondon, United Kingdom26 contributions\n0\nAmazing flavours.\nJan 2026 • Solo\nNot sure if there are two restaurants in this chain as Tripadvisor puts this place on the map somewhere north of the one I visited but I ate at the one just round the corner from the Hoa Lo prison museum at 56 Tho Nhuom street. Do find it, you won't be disappointed. I'm not vegan but the food was amazing, had a Lox bagel that had carrot instead of salmon, was delicious! Highly recommend +\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten February 2, 2026",
